%%{ c4: system-context }%%
graph TB
    Customer[Customer<br/>Person]
    Admin[Administrator<br/>Person]

    EcommerceSystem[E-commerce System<br/>Software System]

    EmailService[Email Service<br/>Software System<br/>External]
    PaymentGateway[Payment Gateway<br/>Software System<br/>External]
    ShippingService[Shipping Service<br/>Software System<br/>External]

    Customer -->|Views products, places orders| EcommerceSystem
    Admin -->|Manages products, views orders| EcommerceSystem

    EcommerceSystem -->|Sends order confirmations| EmailService
    EcommerceSystem -->|Processes payments via| PaymentGateway
    EcommerceSystem -->|Arranges shipping via| ShippingService
